   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European development Fund 2013. EIB EUF 9</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Europeiska utvecklingsfonden 2013. EIB EUF 9</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden&#xb4;s contribution to the European Development Fund (EDF) as stipulated by the International Agreement and the Cotonue Agreement.  The main part of the contribution is managed by the European          Commission, whilst a small part is managed by the European Investment Bank (the so called Investment Facility). There is thus one donor     project No, but two channels of delivery.</narrative>
